WEBVTT

00:14.700 --> 00:17.500
♪The Upper Three hold the seals♪

00:17.540 --> 00:21.380
♪A valiant general, an opera star, and a ruthless cripple♪

00:21.980 --> 00:24.420
♪The Middle Three stir the clouds♪

00:24.500 --> 00:29.140
♪A fiend, a wandering hero, and a master of the blade♪

00:30.540 --> 00:33.220
♪The Lower Three deal in gold♪

00:33.540 --> 00:37.500
♪A beauty, a seer, and a scholar♪

00:37.860 --> 00:40.780
♪The Upper, Middle, and Lower Three♪

00:41.620 --> 00:49.300
♪Represent the nine houses of old Changsha♪

00:49.900 --> 00:51.380
♪Together, they are known♪

00:52.060 --> 00:56.660
♪As the Mystic Nine♪

01:25.660 --> 01:31.900
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

01:32.060 --> 01:34.980
[Episode 25]
[This story is purely fictional]

01:51.800 --> 01:52.560
You again.

02:02.550 --> 02:03.250
The sand.

02:07.600 --> 02:09.090
It's this sand.

02:13.990 --> 02:15.030
There was sand like this

02:15.080 --> 02:16.020
in that golden jar too.

02:18.790 --> 02:19.860
Good catch.

02:21.320 --> 02:22.540
This sand

02:23.230 --> 02:24.930
is everywhere around the Otherworld Tower.

02:25.440 --> 02:26.770
It can disrupt

02:26.790 --> 02:27.700
your memory.

02:33.510 --> 02:34.520
Who exactly are you?

02:45.700 --> 02:47.060
[I am you]

02:47.440 --> 02:48.490
I am you?

02:52.000 --> 02:52.710
Yes.

02:54.070 --> 02:54.890
I am

02:56.160 --> 02:57.540
you.

03:06.920 --> 03:08.210
You finally remembered.

03:10.600 --> 03:11.380
Actually,

03:12.840 --> 03:13.490
I am

03:15.230 --> 03:16.020
you.

03:18.560 --> 03:19.050
You are

03:20.120 --> 03:21.140
me?

03:22.070 --> 03:22.540
Yes.

03:23.750 --> 03:24.770
When you first entered

03:24.790 --> 03:25.820
the Otherworld Tower,

03:26.910 --> 03:28.650
you discovered its secret.

03:30.440 --> 03:31.420
You kept exploring

03:32.560 --> 03:33.450
until you reached this place.

03:35.510 --> 03:36.300
But you knew

03:37.560 --> 03:38.650
everything that happened

03:39.910 --> 03:41.300
would eventually be forgotten.

03:42.280 --> 03:43.050
So all you could do

03:43.070 --> 03:44.300
was leave important clues

03:45.510 --> 03:47.260
for your future self.

03:53.500 --> 03:55.380
[I am you]

03:55.950 --> 03:57.140
To keep you from realizing the truth,

03:57.950 --> 03:59.210
everything was written

03:59.560 --> 04:00.930
with the left hand.

04:04.840 --> 04:05.490
So

04:06.750 --> 04:08.100
you guided me all the way here

04:09.040 --> 04:10.020
to tell me the truth

04:10.040 --> 04:11.050
about the Otherworld Tower?

04:13.350 --> 04:14.300
There's more.

04:15.630 --> 04:16.890
I also want to tell you

04:17.430 --> 04:18.330
how to move forward

04:19.640 --> 04:20.700
from here.

04:25.470 --> 04:26.770
I've figured it out.

04:28.790 --> 04:30.090
But you haven't.

04:31.160 --> 04:32.330
Deep down,

04:32.990 --> 04:34.500
there's a vulnerable side of you

04:36.310 --> 04:37.820
that you've always refused to face.

04:39.870 --> 04:40.330
No.

04:42.470 --> 04:43.260
I'm no longer

04:43.280 --> 04:44.500
the person I used to be.

04:45.160 --> 04:45.770
Are you sure?

04:48.960 --> 04:50.450
Think carefully.

04:52.310 --> 04:53.650
There's one more thing

04:55.080 --> 04:56.140
you haven't realized.

04:58.350 --> 04:59.260
As I just said,

05:00.280 --> 05:00.820
I am

05:01.670 --> 05:02.380
you.

05:04.350 --> 05:04.940
But

05:06.870 --> 05:07.850
you're not me yet.

05:10.470 --> 05:11.140
What?

05:26.990 --> 05:27.620
Laogou.

05:32.160 --> 05:32.970
You must be exhausted

05:34.720 --> 05:35.580
after everything we've been through.

05:40.960 --> 05:42.380
Each floor of the Otherworld Tower is nested within another.

05:44.350 --> 05:45.290
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama

05:45.790 --> 05:47.260
has long since mastered the technique.

05:48.640 --> 05:49.700
You and I are nothing more

05:50.760 --> 05:52.260
than trapped beasts struggling inside a cage.

05:52.600 --> 05:53.700
We'll all die here sooner or later.

05:55.470 --> 05:56.090
Deep down,

05:58.230 --> 05:59.500
we both knew this day would come.

06:01.160 --> 06:01.650
Xiangu,

06:03.230 --> 06:04.210
come with me.

06:05.840 --> 06:06.940
Let's leave the Otherworld Tower.

06:07.080 --> 06:07.820
Leave the Japanese behind.

06:08.040 --> 06:09.330
Leave everything here.

06:10.200 --> 06:11.620
We'll find somewhere beautiful

06:12.910 --> 06:13.850
and live in seclusion together.

06:15.110 --> 06:16.820
Just like we promised before.

06:20.230 --> 06:20.970
Trust me.

06:22.310 --> 06:23.180
I'll take care of everything

06:23.200 --> 06:24.090
from here on out.

06:25.230 --> 06:26.090
As long as I'm here,

06:27.600 --> 06:28.580
you shouldn't have to bear

06:29.280 --> 06:30.650
any of this.

06:36.280 --> 06:36.850
Xiangu,

06:38.910 --> 06:39.740
come with me.

07:08.230 --> 07:08.820
No.

07:10.080 --> 07:10.620
No.

07:12.110 --> 07:12.770
I can't leave.

07:14.640 --> 07:15.620
No matter what happens,

07:16.350 --> 07:17.500
I shouldn't run away.

07:20.200 --> 07:21.330
I don't want to rely on anyone.

07:23.110 --> 07:24.330
I want to rely on myself.

07:41.960 --> 07:43.330
Just as you said,

07:44.310 --> 07:45.740
you're no longer the person you used to be.

07:46.350 --> 07:47.210
Why did you use an illusion

07:47.230 --> 07:48.140
to deceive me?

07:48.550 --> 07:49.580
I didn't deceive you.

07:51.430 --> 07:53.290
Everything you saw in the illusion

07:54.080 --> 07:56.290
came from deep within you.

08:06.720 --> 08:07.620
But

08:07.640 --> 08:08.530
what we're about to do

08:08.990 --> 08:09.970
is very important.

08:10.720 --> 08:11.420
You can't afford any weakness

08:11.420 --> 08:12.740
in your heart.

08:13.720 --> 08:14.770
Not even the slightest desire

08:14.770 --> 08:16.180
to rely on anyone else.

08:17.110 --> 08:17.740
So

08:20.080 --> 08:20.820
you tested me

08:22.910 --> 08:23.820
with Laogou?

08:30.310 --> 08:31.890
The Star-Moon Sand here

08:32.360 --> 08:33.170
is incredibly powerful.

08:36.430 --> 08:37.650
It pieces together your memories

08:38.360 --> 08:39.260
and attacks

08:39.280 --> 08:40.410
the deepest parts of your mind.

08:42.400 --> 08:44.290
If there's even the slightest weakness,

08:45.880 --> 08:46.570
you could be trapped

08:47.760 --> 08:49.980
in this cycle forever.

08:55.520 --> 08:57.380
So many Otherworld Towers were built here.

08:58.000 --> 08:59.460
Could they be connected to that building?

09:15.640 --> 09:16.650
I couldn't bring myself

09:16.670 --> 09:17.890
to kill the members of Unit 401,

09:18.640 --> 09:20.140
so I reluctantly agreed to help Hatoyama

09:20.240 --> 09:21.260
find the Star-Moon Sand.

09:23.550 --> 09:23.980
But I never expected

09:24.000 --> 09:24.980
there to be so many Zhainiangniang

09:25.710 --> 09:27.050
inside the infinite Otherworld Towers.

09:33.120 --> 09:34.220
I spent a long time

09:34.550 --> 09:35.650
taming those Zhainiangniang

09:35.670 --> 09:36.690
the Japanese captured.

09:37.280 --> 09:37.930
I led the Japanese

09:37.960 --> 09:38.980
through this place.

09:45.120 --> 09:46.140
But deeper inside,

09:46.640 --> 09:47.810
the Otherworld Towers were still nested within one another.

09:48.640 --> 09:49.530
There was no pattern at all.

09:50.710 --> 09:51.690
We couldn't find where the Star-Moon Sand

09:51.710 --> 09:53.140
Hatoyama wanted was.

10:16.670 --> 10:17.410
Be careful.

10:19.360 --> 10:19.890
Open it.

10:37.000 --> 10:38.260
It's Star-Moon Sand, sir.

10:38.670 --> 10:39.740
But there's too little,

10:40.070 --> 10:41.220
and there are too many impurities.

10:48.670 --> 10:49.860
Days went by like this.

10:50.790 --> 10:51.860
Hatoyama grew increasingly dissatisfied.

10:53.760 --> 10:54.860
The supplies the Japanese brought in

10:54.880 --> 10:55.770
were running out.

10:58.070 --> 10:59.860
This Star-Moon Sand is very impure.

11:00.670 --> 11:01.380
When will you find

11:01.400 --> 11:02.690
the high-purity Star-Moon Sand

11:03.190 --> 11:04.380
I want?

11:09.070 --> 11:10.100
I told you.

11:11.070 --> 11:12.340
I can only search a little at a time.

11:14.640 --> 11:16.140
If you're not happy with this, find it yourselves.

11:37.550 --> 11:38.260
Don't!

11:45.240 --> 11:46.620
It's been so long, and you still haven't found

11:46.640 --> 11:48.170
any high-purity Star-Moon Sand.

11:48.360 --> 11:49.050
Our men

11:49.070 --> 11:50.460
are getting weaker,

11:50.670 --> 11:52.410
while those from Unit 401 are perfectly fine.

11:52.790 --> 11:54.460
What are you up to?

11:54.590 --> 11:55.860
What does it have to do with me?

11:57.310 --> 11:58.290
We eat together.

11:58.300 --> 11:59.170
We sleep together.

11:59.830 --> 12:01.410
You even know when I take a dump.

12:03.910 --> 12:05.690
This tower is trying to kill you all.

12:15.190 --> 12:16.410
You're good at taming dogs, aren't you?

12:17.320 --> 12:18.380
Let him find

12:18.670 --> 12:20.340
the Star-Moon Sand instead.

12:24.070 --> 12:24.650
What?

12:25.430 --> 12:26.170
You won't?

12:27.830 --> 12:28.500
Fine.

12:29.360 --> 12:30.170
If so,

12:30.960 --> 12:32.620
I'll have the entire Unit 401

12:32.630 --> 12:33.530
buried with you.

12:40.640 --> 12:41.340
Wu Laogou,

12:42.430 --> 12:43.770
I'll count to three.

12:46.710 --> 12:47.380
Three.

12:51.670 --> 12:52.340
Two.

12:59.160 --> 12:59.870
One.

12:59.870 --> 13:00.620
Fine!

13:15.040 --> 13:16.260
I'll have him lead the way

13:17.550 --> 13:18.980
and find you the Star-Moon Sand.

13:26.950 --> 13:27.810
Coward.

13:36.830 --> 13:38.530
You coward.

13:40.640 --> 13:42.050
I'm not Zhang Qishan.

13:43.640 --> 13:44.810
There's nothing I can do.

13:47.880 --> 13:48.890
Take this pill.

13:50.520 --> 13:51.930
It'll make you obey.

13:54.240 --> 13:55.290
Coward.

13:55.880 --> 13:57.500
You coward!

14:03.190 --> 14:04.500
Hang in there.

14:04.640 --> 14:05.770
I'll get you out of here.

14:05.790 --> 14:06.810
It's pointless.

14:06.960 --> 14:07.860
I'm in so much pain.

14:08.220 --> 14:09.130
Kill me.

14:09.130 --> 14:10.460
Just kill me.

15:05.070 --> 15:05.650
Sir,

15:06.000 --> 15:07.020
he put him out of his misery.

15:07.240 --> 15:08.810
He just destroyed our only lead to the Star-Moon Sand.

15:08.880 --> 15:09.650
We can't trust him.

15:22.550 --> 15:24.220
We've all been poisoned already.

15:25.760 --> 15:27.340
Am I right, Yoshiyuki Hatoyama?

15:28.280 --> 15:29.410
The Star-Moon Sand is poisonous.

15:30.710 --> 15:31.860
It's extremely dangerous.

15:33.070 --> 15:34.170
Star-Moon Sand dust

15:34.190 --> 15:35.340
is everywhere here.

15:35.910 --> 15:37.220
The concentration is low,

15:38.040 --> 15:39.460
but we're healthy

15:39.460 --> 15:40.410
and breathe faster,

15:41.550 --> 15:42.650
so we've naturally been poisoned.

15:43.910 --> 15:44.810
But the Unit 401 soldiers

15:44.830 --> 15:45.650
you drugged

15:46.310 --> 15:47.410
are weak

15:47.880 --> 15:48.570
and have shallow breathing.

15:49.000 --> 15:49.930
So even though they're poisoned,

15:51.400 --> 15:52.980
they can hold out longer.

15:57.160 --> 15:58.170
Now that he's dead,

15:59.520 --> 16:00.570
you'll have to turn

16:00.590 --> 16:01.380
the Unit 401 soldiers

16:01.400 --> 16:02.410
into Zhainiangniang again

16:02.550 --> 16:03.530
and have them lead the way.

16:05.240 --> 16:06.100
That means

16:07.480 --> 16:09.260
you'll have to spend even more time

16:10.430 --> 16:11.570
mutating them.

16:12.430 --> 16:13.770
If we stay here too long,

16:14.360 --> 16:15.290
we could

16:15.310 --> 16:16.650
all die here

16:16.670 --> 16:18.020
from the Star-Moon Sand poisoning.

16:24.160 --> 16:25.020
But maybe not.

16:26.040 --> 16:27.050
We don't know

16:27.880 --> 16:29.530
what the Star-Moon Sand

16:29.550 --> 16:30.620
will do to people.

16:31.640 --> 16:32.890
Am I right,

16:34.070 --> 16:35.260
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama?

16:37.760 --> 16:38.340
Go on.

16:39.240 --> 16:40.140
What kind of deal

16:40.160 --> 16:41.140
do you want to make with me?

16:41.790 --> 16:43.410
I want you and your men

16:43.830 --> 16:45.460
to retreat outside Zhainiangniang Square.

16:45.710 --> 16:46.410
Stay in an area

16:46.430 --> 16:47.740
free of Star-Moon Sand dust.

16:49.190 --> 16:50.260
Let Unit 401 go in

16:51.040 --> 16:52.410
and search for the Star-Moon Sand with me.

16:56.040 --> 16:56.860
Zhainiangniang Square

16:56.880 --> 16:57.890
is the only way out.

16:59.280 --> 17:00.290
I can't escape.

17:00.670 --> 17:01.260
But this way,

17:02.040 --> 17:03.340
you can get what you want

17:03.360 --> 17:04.530
without suffering any losses.

17:06.040 --> 17:06.700
Sir.

17:15.770 --> 17:16.980
Hatoyama was extremely cautious.

17:17.680 --> 17:18.980
He only gave me enough food for three days.

17:19.960 --> 17:20.570
Every three days,

17:20.590 --> 17:21.400
I had to bring out

17:21.400 --> 17:22.290
whatever I found

17:23.070 --> 17:24.660
and exchange it for another three days' worth of supplies.

17:27.760 --> 17:29.290
Hatoyama retreated outside Zhainiangniang Square.

17:30.000 --> 17:30.700
Everyone, stay close.

17:31.830 --> 17:32.940
Unit 401 and I continued deeper

17:32.960 --> 17:33.810
to find a way out.

17:35.150 --> 17:36.220
We searched for days.

17:37.110 --> 17:37.940
The poison from the pills

17:37.960 --> 17:38.740
inside their bodies

17:38.760 --> 17:39.570
gradually wore off.

17:46.070 --> 17:46.980
But while

17:47.000 --> 17:47.900
we were exploring,

17:48.590 --> 17:50.050
the Japanese drugged us with the Star-Moon Sand.

17:51.070 --> 17:52.130
Our memories became scrambled.

18:01.390 --> 18:02.370
I want to get out of this ruddy place.

18:02.590 --> 18:03.660
- I want to get out of here!
- Fifth Master.

18:03.680 --> 18:04.830
Fifth Master!

18:05.500 --> 18:06.260
Calm down.

18:08.640 --> 18:10.070
Zhang... Zhang Peiwu.

18:11.220 --> 18:11.850
Fifth Master,

18:13.830 --> 18:14.980
you didn't kill

18:15.830 --> 18:16.740
any of our men.

18:17.960 --> 18:18.900
It was the Japanese.

18:21.870 --> 18:22.500
The Japanese did.

18:27.280 --> 18:27.770
Look.

18:29.240 --> 18:30.050
Those Japanese

18:30.630 --> 18:31.420
went back on their word.

18:31.920 --> 18:32.900
They followed us all the way here.

18:33.830 --> 18:34.810
When we discovered them,

18:35.910 --> 18:36.660
they attacked.

18:37.120 --> 18:37.800
Fifth Master,

18:39.870 --> 18:41.090
you saved me.

18:42.280 --> 18:43.700
You killed the Japanese.

18:51.110 --> 18:51.660
Fifth Master,

18:52.200 --> 18:53.020
I found a scroll

18:53.390 --> 18:54.130
on him.

18:54.520 --> 18:55.770
It's Yin Changsheng's experimental records.

18:56.070 --> 18:57.030
I don't know if it'll be useful.

18:57.310 --> 18:57.850
Take a look.

19:06.680 --> 19:07.570
What does this say?

19:08.240 --> 19:09.130
"Those who take Lifeswapping Herb

19:09.550 --> 19:11.740
will have their pulse nearly stop,

19:12.280 --> 19:13.180
as if in a dream.

19:14.000 --> 19:16.090
Only Star-Moon Sand can cure its poison."

19:21.240 --> 19:22.370
Star-Moon Sand

19:23.960 --> 19:25.290
can cure the poison of Lifeswapping Herb?

19:39.000 --> 19:39.700
Don't feel guilty.

19:40.760 --> 19:41.740
You did everything you could.

19:44.590 --> 19:45.330
What do you think

19:45.350 --> 19:46.500
the Japanese need so much Star-Moon Sand for?

19:46.720 --> 19:47.850
What exactly do they want it for?

19:49.000 --> 19:50.260
They want to use the Star-Moon Sand

19:51.550 --> 19:52.810
on the Chinese people.

19:54.200 --> 19:55.420
What will happen

19:55.520 --> 19:56.180
if they use it on the Chinese?

19:57.130 --> 19:58.320
Star-Moon Sand can numb

19:58.320 --> 19:59.290
the Chinese people's will

19:59.830 --> 20:01.330
and weaken the army's fighting ability.

20:02.150 --> 20:02.700
It can even

20:04.040 --> 20:05.370
make us turn against one another,

20:06.000 --> 20:07.020
allowing them to achieve victory

20:07.040 --> 20:08.260
without having to fight.

20:08.830 --> 20:09.850
Master Zhang is right.

20:10.790 --> 20:11.370
That's why

20:12.520 --> 20:14.420
I absolutely can't let Hatoyama succeed.

20:15.480 --> 20:16.740
It took me a long time,

20:17.350 --> 20:18.700
but I finally found a cliff.

20:19.480 --> 20:20.180
Climbing up led to a cave

20:20.440 --> 20:21.980
that connected to an underground river.

20:23.040 --> 20:23.660
It was also the place

20:24.390 --> 20:25.770
where I had once been imprisoned.

20:47.500 --> 20:51.500
[Xumi Realm]

21:12.550 --> 21:13.700
I discovered a pool

21:13.760 --> 21:15.050
the Japanese had never explored.

21:15.870 --> 21:16.610
A soul-summoning banner

21:17.040 --> 21:18.420
was floating on the water.

21:19.720 --> 21:20.850
This water has to be constantly flowing.

21:20.860 --> 21:21.540
[Memorial]

21:21.720 --> 21:22.530
And it was connected to the underground river

21:22.550 --> 21:24.090
the Japanese had taken me to.

21:41.040 --> 21:42.460
But Unit 401 was too weak

21:43.200 --> 21:44.740
to make it out.

21:46.110 --> 21:47.090
So I had to hide them somewhere,

21:47.110 --> 21:47.850
and go out alone

21:48.680 --> 21:49.850
to get help.

21:51.070 --> 21:51.980
Then I'd come back for them

21:53.000 --> 21:53.850
and wait for the right moment

21:55.070 --> 21:56.290
to strike back at the Japanese.

22:22.520 --> 22:22.940
Here.

22:24.550 --> 22:25.330
These pills are made

22:25.350 --> 22:26.090
from Lifeswapping Herb.

22:26.920 --> 22:28.180
They can slow the heartbeat,

22:28.550 --> 22:29.530
like hibernation.

22:30.550 --> 22:31.610
Even without food or water,

22:31.870 --> 22:33.180
they can keep you going for half a month.

22:35.550 --> 22:36.130
Fifth Master.

22:37.070 --> 22:37.850
Tell Master Zhang

22:38.550 --> 22:39.770
to kill all the Japanese.

22:40.870 --> 22:42.020
We can't let them succeed.

22:44.240 --> 22:45.500
Don't worry about us.

22:46.350 --> 22:47.330
Stopping Hatoyama

22:47.590 --> 22:48.770
is what matters most.

22:54.760 --> 22:55.520
Fifth Master,

22:57.390 --> 22:58.130
please.

23:02.830 --> 23:03.420
Don't worry.

23:04.590 --> 23:06.020
I'll pass the message to Zhang Qishan.

23:07.760 --> 23:08.610
Quick, take the medicine.

23:09.280 --> 23:09.770
Come on.

23:11.910 --> 23:12.370
Here.

23:12.550 --> 23:13.290
Take one.

23:14.960 --> 23:15.460
Here.

23:18.440 --> 23:19.020
This is yours.

23:19.720 --> 23:20.180
Come on.

23:24.310 --> 23:25.050
Fifth Master.

23:35.590 --> 23:36.500
Salute!

23:55.590 --> 23:56.660
So I wrote down

23:56.680 --> 23:57.290
everything I had experienced

23:58.040 --> 23:58.900
and carried it with me.

24:11.590 --> 24:12.130
I also

24:13.110 --> 24:13.980
made a backup

24:14.000 --> 24:14.900
and hid it inside an Otherworld Tower,

24:15.590 --> 24:16.370
just in case.

24:17.630 --> 24:18.700
When I came back,

24:19.960 --> 24:21.260
it would help me remember everything.

24:29.150 --> 24:30.330
To get out of here

24:30.870 --> 24:32.130
and avoid being captured by the Japanese again,

24:33.590 --> 24:35.090
I used what I found in the cave

24:35.520 --> 24:36.420
to set up a trap.

24:39.920 --> 24:40.900
I found the way out,

24:41.870 --> 24:43.290
but there were Japanese soldiers

24:43.720 --> 24:45.050
guarding the exit of the underground river,

24:45.680 --> 24:46.940
and a giant Zhainiangniang

24:46.960 --> 24:47.850
was lurking in the river behind me.

24:49.150 --> 24:49.940
It'd be risky

24:50.790 --> 24:51.740
to go out like this.

24:52.960 --> 24:54.290
So I needed a foolproof plan.

24:56.440 --> 24:57.530
I made a meatball

24:57.720 --> 24:58.660
with fish and Lifeswapping Herb.

24:59.280 --> 25:00.420
Then I dove underwater and escaped.

26:10.520 --> 26:11.370
Forgive me.

26:11.520 --> 26:12.770
Forgive me.

26:13.280 --> 26:14.050
Forgive me.

27:46.760 --> 27:47.420
At the same time,

27:48.160 --> 27:49.570
I hid all the key information

27:49.570 --> 27:50.500
inside my body.

29:46.390 --> 29:47.570
I discovered that Star-Moon Sand

29:48.110 --> 29:49.570
could neutralize the poison from Lifeswapping Herb.

29:50.680 --> 29:51.220
So

29:51.920 --> 29:53.570
I took a pill made from it

29:54.520 --> 29:55.940
to slow my heartbeat

29:56.920 --> 29:58.130
and enter a near-death state.

29:59.280 --> 29:59.850
Then,

30:00.870 --> 30:02.370
I carried the antidote made from Star-Moon Sand

30:03.480 --> 30:04.530
and fell into a deep sleep.

30:08.240 --> 30:09.740
I managed to escape,

30:10.960 --> 30:12.460
but I never expected

30:13.920 --> 30:15.530
that being stuck in that box without air for so long

30:16.310 --> 30:17.530
would make me lose my memory.

30:18.520 --> 30:19.090
So

30:19.960 --> 30:21.330
it took us a long time

30:22.550 --> 30:23.610
to find our way back here.

30:37.980 --> 30:42.860
♪See the moon, indelible as ink...♪

30:43.280 --> 30:44.330
I'm sorry, Master Zhang.

30:44.340 --> 30:46.380
♪As red plum blossoms fall along the street...♪

30:46.960 --> 30:48.460
I killed Zhang Yuanhang.

30:50.760 --> 30:51.770
Don't blame yourself.

30:53.720 --> 30:54.330
I told you.

30:55.150 --> 30:55.850
I believe you.

30:57.110 --> 30:57.930
You are absolutely not

30:57.930 --> 30:59.020
the kind of person you think you are.

31:00.200 --> 31:01.700
I doubted myself before

31:03.790 --> 31:04.530
because deep down,

31:04.550 --> 31:05.800
I was really afraid.

31:06.630 --> 31:07.220
I thought I was someone

31:07.220 --> 31:08.420
who could kill innocent people.

31:10.720 --> 31:12.530
I was afraid Zhang Yuanhang would hurt me,

31:13.920 --> 31:14.570
so I killed him.

31:16.740 --> 31:19.020
♪I drink a cup of rough wine♪

31:19.020 --> 31:24.180
♪Right and wrong pass with the changing seasons...♪

31:26.040 --> 31:27.180
We all

31:27.190 --> 31:28.090
have fear deep down.

31:29.440 --> 31:30.180
Courage

31:31.520 --> 31:32.900
only comes

31:32.920 --> 31:33.740
when we're faced with a choice.

31:37.310 --> 31:38.810
So before you have to choose,

31:39.870 --> 31:41.100
it's fine to be weak.

31:41.100 --> 31:47.500
♪When flowers fall and you return, I wish time could turn back♪

31:47.860 --> 31:53.700
♪I'll share with you the lingering taste of new wine...♪

31:54.630 --> 31:56.050
About what happened to Wu Tie back then,

31:58.110 --> 31:58.850
I think I finally understand

31:58.870 --> 32:00.020
why you did what you did.

32:00.060 --> 32:06.180
♪When a thousand sails ride wind and waves home, I'll sail with you again♪

32:06.460 --> 32:12.620
♪When flowers fall and you return, I wish time could turn back♪

32:13.140 --> 32:17.660
♪Before the night grows cold, old tales replay a thousand times...♪

32:19.040 --> 32:19.700
Yes.

32:20.680 --> 32:21.570
You were right this time.

32:22.150 --> 32:23.180
I didn't betray my country

32:23.240 --> 32:24.090
or my people.

32:25.720 --> 32:27.050
And I certainly didn't harm Unit 401.

32:27.260 --> 32:33.060
♪I'll share with you the lingering taste of new wine♪

32:34.100 --> 32:36.060
♪And get drunk with you♪

32:38.550 --> 32:40.610
Thank goodness!

32:40.630 --> 32:42.020
The ancestors must be watching over us.

32:42.110 --> 32:43.510
You two

32:43.510 --> 32:44.570
finally made peace.

32:46.350 --> 32:48.660
Does that mean the oath I swore

32:49.070 --> 32:50.420
doesn't count anymore?

32:52.280 --> 32:53.220
Thank goodness!

32:53.760 --> 32:54.770
You were just saying

32:55.240 --> 32:56.500
the Mystic Nine would fall apart.

32:57.000 --> 32:57.570
Looks like

32:57.960 --> 32:59.090
that's not happening.

32:59.830 --> 33:00.980
So you've remembered everything

33:01.590 --> 33:02.370
that happened before?

33:03.310 --> 33:03.900
That's right.

33:05.000 --> 33:06.290
The last time I was here,

33:06.870 --> 33:08.020
I'd already mapped out

33:08.040 --> 33:08.900
the infinite Otherworld Tower.

33:09.590 --> 33:11.050
The place where I hid Unit 401

33:11.680 --> 33:12.570
is very close

33:12.590 --> 33:13.530
to where Yoshiyuki Hatoyama

33:14.000 --> 33:14.570
was trying to get to.

33:28.440 --> 33:29.460
The Xumi Realm

33:30.350 --> 33:31.850
is one enormous underground cavern.

33:32.390 --> 33:33.020
Someone had been building

33:33.040 --> 33:34.020
Otherworld Towers here one after another.

33:34.720 --> 33:35.940
All using the same design.

33:36.240 --> 33:37.020
They just built

33:37.020 --> 33:37.660
more and more,

33:38.070 --> 33:38.740
until eventually,

33:39.280 --> 33:40.570
the towers were all connected.

33:44.200 --> 33:44.900
So

33:46.390 --> 33:47.180
you're saying

33:48.480 --> 33:50.090
the entire underground cavern

33:50.760 --> 33:52.420
is filled with Otherworld Towers

33:52.440 --> 33:53.220
from different eras?

33:57.830 --> 33:58.810
I've been wondering.

33:59.590 --> 34:00.660
Could it be that everyone

34:00.720 --> 34:01.740
who gained something from the Xumi Realm

34:02.000 --> 34:02.980
had to build

34:03.280 --> 34:04.290
an Otherworld Tower here

34:05.790 --> 34:06.530
as an offering?

34:07.440 --> 34:08.530
Eventually, the old and new towers

34:08.750 --> 34:09.650
became connected.

34:10.110 --> 34:11.380
I've seen something similar before.

34:12.710 --> 34:13.690
A family tomb.

34:15.230 --> 34:16.420
Every time they held a ritual,

34:16.840 --> 34:18.420
they built another tomb gate.

34:19.520 --> 34:20.340
That family continued

34:20.630 --> 34:21.860
for over two thousand years.

34:22.750 --> 34:24.170
The tomb gates were built one after another,

34:24.920 --> 34:27.380
forming something like a dragon.

34:28.840 --> 34:29.650
But why did they

34:30.190 --> 34:31.570
keep building these towers?

34:35.630 --> 34:36.500
There's a theory

34:38.070 --> 34:39.210
that if you want to attain

34:39.230 --> 34:40.210
a certain kind of blessing,

34:41.630 --> 34:42.340
you have

34:42.360 --> 34:43.530
to build a tower

34:44.070 --> 34:44.780
in a place with good feng shui.

34:46.880 --> 34:48.610
Then you build an identical tower

34:49.190 --> 34:50.780
where you want to live.

34:53.480 --> 34:54.610
You plant your hair

34:55.000 --> 34:55.730
and fingernails

34:56.320 --> 34:57.690
in the feng shui tower

34:58.110 --> 34:58.940
while you

34:59.400 --> 35:00.420
continue living

35:00.440 --> 35:01.300
in the other one.

35:02.630 --> 35:04.250
It's a way of bringing

35:04.590 --> 35:05.860
the good feng shui into your own life.

35:09.550 --> 35:10.420
So you're saying

35:11.110 --> 35:12.530
the people who entered the Xumi Realm

35:12.960 --> 35:14.250
discovered some kind of special power

35:14.320 --> 35:15.530
within these towers.

35:15.960 --> 35:17.130
To bring that power outside,

35:17.480 --> 35:18.380
they had to build

35:18.400 --> 35:19.250
an Otherworld Tower here,

35:19.320 --> 35:20.170
and

35:20.840 --> 35:22.500
another identical one outside,

35:23.480 --> 35:25.170
so the energy between the two towers

35:25.400 --> 35:26.380
could remain connected.

35:26.840 --> 35:27.250
Exactly.

35:27.800 --> 35:29.170
Why did it have to be an Otherworld Tower?

35:29.320 --> 35:30.340
Couldn't it be an Eight Great Alley?
[*Brothel]

35:36.710 --> 35:39.170
Master Zhang, I was just joking.

35:42.440 --> 35:43.530
The shape of each tower

35:44.040 --> 35:45.340
must've been strictly prescribed, right?

35:45.590 --> 35:46.170
Exactly.

35:47.110 --> 35:48.250
This is what the infinite Otherworld Tower looked like

35:48.590 --> 35:50.090
after I finished exploring it.

35:50.750 --> 35:51.900
The infinite Otherworld Tower

35:52.480 --> 35:54.420
is shaped like a morning glory.

35:55.070 --> 35:56.050
This morning glory

35:56.520 --> 35:57.570
must've been

35:57.710 --> 35:59.210
one of Yin Changsheng's signature symbols.

35:59.800 --> 36:00.570
That's why he incorporated it

36:00.590 --> 36:01.530
into the entire structure

36:01.670 --> 36:02.570
of the infinite Otherworld Tower.

36:04.070 --> 36:04.610
Look.

36:06.040 --> 36:06.690
This is where

36:07.360 --> 36:08.780
I hid Unit 401.

36:10.590 --> 36:11.130
And this is where

36:12.320 --> 36:13.300
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama

36:13.400 --> 36:14.210
was trying to get to.

36:14.880 --> 36:18.170
The fruit of the morning glory.

36:18.630 --> 36:19.420
This must be where

36:19.440 --> 36:20.650
all of Yin Changsheng's secrets are hidden.

36:21.440 --> 36:22.530
That's why Yoshiyuki Hatoyama

36:23.150 --> 36:24.380
is so obsessed with it.

36:28.320 --> 36:28.900
Hatoyama!

36:39.520 --> 36:40.130
Do you think

36:40.630 --> 36:42.940
Hatoyama already knows

36:43.480 --> 36:44.860
where the fruit chamber is?

36:45.040 --> 36:45.780
Tiezui, Xiaoyu,

36:46.400 --> 36:47.340
go rescue Unit 401.

36:48.040 --> 36:48.690
Laogou and I

36:48.840 --> 36:49.610
will go to the fruit chamber.

36:50.270 --> 36:50.690
Got it.

37:03.040 --> 37:04.500
The structure of this tower

37:05.710 --> 37:07.300
is like a morning glory vine.

37:11.110 --> 37:12.780
Its inner workings are incredibly intricate.

37:14.400 --> 37:15.820
This is the fruit of the morning glory.

37:16.440 --> 37:17.530
It's the most important place

37:17.550 --> 37:18.500
in the entire tower,

37:19.630 --> 37:20.980
and the source of Star-Moon Sand.

37:22.750 --> 37:23.570
As long as Star-Moon Sand

37:23.590 --> 37:25.020
continues to be produced,

37:25.750 --> 37:26.820
the cycle here

37:27.800 --> 37:29.500
will never end.

37:52.110 --> 37:53.090
He only gave us

37:53.110 --> 37:54.500
such a tiny piece of paper.

37:54.880 --> 37:55.730
I can't even make out

37:55.750 --> 37:56.690
the map on it.

37:57.400 --> 37:58.340
How are we supposed to find it?

38:01.480 --> 38:01.940
Stinky Yu.

38:11.880 --> 38:12.650
I think it's here.

38:13.320 --> 38:14.900
You can find it from this?

38:17.880 --> 38:18.530
Impressive.

38:19.480 --> 38:20.020
Stay put.

38:22.190 --> 38:22.820
What's wrong?

38:31.750 --> 38:32.730
My goodness.

38:33.230 --> 38:34.460
There's a mechanism here too.

38:35.520 --> 38:36.420
The mechanism is very unique.

38:37.270 --> 38:38.130
It was designed by Master Zhang.

38:39.480 --> 38:40.610
Only Zhang family soldiers can disarm it.

38:41.040 --> 38:42.210
You mean

38:42.930 --> 38:45.090
Unit 401 set up this mechanism?

38:49.590 --> 38:50.690
Looks like this is exactly

38:52.040 --> 38:53.650
Yin Changsheng's alchemy chamber

38:54.040 --> 38:55.780
Hatoyama has been dreaming of.

39:15.640 --> 39:17.020
So much dynamite.

39:18.470 --> 39:19.530
Fifth Master was right.

39:20.230 --> 39:21.380
Unit 401 is here.

39:26.920 --> 39:27.460
If this mechanism isn't disarmed

39:27.480 --> 39:28.730
by someone from the Zhang family,

39:29.710 --> 39:30.980
we'll all die together.

39:31.710 --> 39:32.730
Die together?

39:35.320 --> 39:36.900
Good thing you came with me.

39:50.630 --> 39:51.090
Hey.

39:52.270 --> 39:52.730
Hey.

39:56.000 --> 39:56.530
Hey.

40:00.480 --> 40:02.090
Xiaoyu, he's still breathing.

40:04.230 --> 40:05.610
His skin has aged so much.

40:06.150 --> 40:07.380
It must be a side effect

40:07.400 --> 40:08.300
from Lifeswapping Herb.

40:10.270 --> 40:10.900
But

40:11.630 --> 40:12.460
how are we supposed to get them out?

40:15.230 --> 40:16.170
Since this was

40:16.800 --> 40:18.460
Yin Changsheng's alchemy chamber,

40:18.800 --> 40:19.380
we should be able to find

40:19.800 --> 40:20.940
an antidote here.

40:33.710 --> 40:34.210
Eighth Master.

40:36.550 --> 40:37.650
Why do you think Fifth Master discovered this place

40:38.440 --> 40:39.460
but didn't destroy it right away?

40:40.070 --> 40:40.780
Instead,

40:40.800 --> 40:41.460
he hid Unit 401 away.

40:42.230 --> 40:43.130
Are you stupid?

40:43.880 --> 40:45.210
How could he move

40:45.550 --> 40:46.530
a furnace this huge?

40:46.800 --> 40:47.530
And it can't be destroyed either.

40:47.920 --> 40:49.090
He had no choice.

40:49.880 --> 40:50.650
Fifth Master

40:51.110 --> 40:52.650
must have figured

40:52.670 --> 40:53.730
Hatoyama would never find this place,

40:54.080 --> 40:54.900
so

40:55.060 --> 40:56.900
he hid Unit 401 here.

40:59.840 --> 41:01.610
"Chief Extraction Supervisor.

41:03.190 --> 41:04.900
To obtain the Star-Moon Sand,

41:06.150 --> 41:07.820
one must wait until midnight on the Jiazi night,

41:08.800 --> 41:10.940
when the moon lies between the Dipper and Ox constellations,

41:12.270 --> 41:13.820
under a cloudless sky.

41:17.590 --> 41:18.900
Only then can one obtain

41:19.630 --> 41:21.940
the black, shining Star-Moon pill.

41:23.440 --> 41:24.380
This pill

41:25.120 --> 41:26.650
can change one's fate.

41:27.550 --> 41:29.980
Unless one seeks the supreme path of cultivation,

41:30.960 --> 41:31.820
it must not be taken lightly."

41:36.710 --> 41:37.380
Could it be

41:39.000 --> 41:40.210
that this alchemy furnace...

42:06.000 --> 42:07.090
It's Star-Moon Sand.

42:07.880 --> 42:08.780
The ancient records say

42:09.270 --> 42:10.020
this furnace

42:11.150 --> 42:12.420
was used by Yin Changsheng

42:12.440 --> 42:13.530
to refine

42:13.590 --> 42:14.610
purer Star-Moon Sand.

42:15.360 --> 42:15.780
Don't touch them.

42:17.150 --> 42:18.300
Be careful when you deal with it.

42:29.870 --> 42:30.500
Eighth Master,

42:31.440 --> 42:32.570
are you sure this is the antidote?

42:33.400 --> 42:34.210
What if something goes wrong?

42:37.110 --> 42:38.250
Do you have another option?

42:39.520 --> 42:40.420
Sit him up.

42:43.270 --> 42:44.020
Hurry.

43:04.150 --> 43:05.460
Give him some time to react.

43:18.630 --> 43:19.300
Eighth Master.

43:21.590 --> 43:22.980
Yes, it's me.

43:24.190 --> 43:25.050
This is great.

43:28.520 --> 43:29.420
Adjutant Xiaoyu.

43:31.230 --> 43:31.900
Stinky Yu.

43:32.590 --> 43:33.820
Looks like the pill really works.

43:34.000 --> 43:34.860
Quick, give one to everyone.

43:35.150 --> 43:35.530
Go.

43:37.230 --> 43:38.250
You were here

43:38.270 --> 43:39.380
a few days ago.

43:40.400 --> 43:42.210
You just forgot

43:42.520 --> 43:43.170
because of Star-Moon Sand.

43:48.320 --> 43:49.690
This is what you discovered.

43:51.920 --> 43:53.130
The Japanese are also trying

43:53.150 --> 43:54.730
to reach the place where the fruit is.

43:55.800 --> 43:57.610
They want to obtain this Star-Moon Sand.

43:58.190 --> 43:59.170
But that would be disastrous

43:59.440 --> 44:00.250
for us.

44:01.800 --> 44:02.940
So if we find the place

44:03.040 --> 44:04.380
where the fruit is,

44:04.550 --> 44:05.500
we destroy it and stop everything.

44:06.070 --> 44:06.900
Unfortunately,

44:07.800 --> 44:08.650
this place

44:09.960 --> 44:11.420
can't be completely destroyed.

44:12.800 --> 44:13.610
The place you need to go

44:15.230 --> 44:15.900
is here.

44:23.890 --> 44:25.380
This is the root of the morning glory.

44:27.000 --> 44:28.340
We can put an end to everything

44:29.070 --> 44:30.340
if we destroy this place.

44:36.360 --> 44:38.170
You won't be able to do this alone.

44:39.110 --> 44:40.420
You'd better regroup

44:40.440 --> 44:41.250
with your companions first.

44:42.710 --> 44:44.020
They're just ahead.

44:48.630 --> 44:49.380
Nian,

44:51.230 --> 44:52.820
as long as you believe in yourself,

44:55.520 --> 44:56.250
your wishes

44:57.520 --> 44:58.500
can come true.

45:02.630 --> 45:03.170
Oh, right.

45:06.480 --> 45:07.940
I used Wu Laogou to test you

45:10.000 --> 45:11.530
because I've finally realized

45:13.040 --> 45:14.020
that things between us

45:14.710 --> 45:15.780
were never meant to work out.

45:18.400 --> 45:19.690
But the final choice

45:20.750 --> 45:21.860
is yours to make.

45:28.800 --> 45:29.570
Huo Jinnian,

45:30.440 --> 45:31.050
remember this.

45:31.920 --> 45:32.730
Only you

45:33.190 --> 45:34.570
can save yourself.

45:58.940 --> 46:03.100
♪The past fades like smoke♪

46:03.460 --> 46:06.180
♪A choice is made in silence♪

46:06.460 --> 46:09.260
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

46:09.660 --> 46:13.420
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

46:13.660 --> 46:17.100
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

46:17.380 --> 46:20.780
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

46:20.860 --> 46:28.140
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

46:28.580 --> 46:31.860
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

46:32.140 --> 46:35.380
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

46:35.540 --> 46:39.580
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

46:39.780 --> 46:43.140
♪Who believes in fate?♪

46:43.380 --> 46:46.740
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

46:46.980 --> 46:50.260
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

46:50.580 --> 46:54.260
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

46:54.460 --> 46:57.700
♪Take care♪

46:57.700 --> 47:00.260
♪We once raced♪

47:00.340 --> 47:02.260
♪For the dawn♪

47:02.420 --> 47:05.700
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

47:05.820 --> 47:09.100
♪In the web of fate♪

47:09.100 --> 47:12.300
♪No one can escape♪

47:13.300 --> 47:15.140
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

47:15.300 --> 47:16.860
♪We too were young once♪

47:16.940 --> 47:20.380
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

47:20.580 --> 47:22.900
♪Keep the ember lit♪

47:23.020 --> 47:27.540
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

47:27.660 --> 47:30.620
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

47:30.860 --> 47:34.380
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

47:34.500 --> 47:38.260
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

47:38.580 --> 47:42.060
♪Who believes in fate?♪

47:42.220 --> 47:45.220
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

47:45.460 --> 47:49.220
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

47:49.380 --> 47:53.100
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

47:53.220 --> 48:04.660
♪Please, do take care of yourself♪
